<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Balloon Pop Archery</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&family=VT323&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  html, body { margin:0; padding:0; height:100%; overflow:hidden; background:#0b1020; }
  #wrap { position:fixed; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  canvas { display:block; image-rendering:pixelated; box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,.6); }
  #hud {
    position:fixed; top:10px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    font-family:'Press Start 2P', monospace; color:#fff; text-align:center;
    text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000; pointer-events:none; user-select:none;
  }
  #hud .score { font-size:20px; }
  #hud .lives { font-size:14px; margin-top:8px; color:#ff6b6b; }
  #overlay {
    position:fixed; inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background:rgba(5,8,20,.75); font-family:'Press Start 2P', monospace; color:#fff; text-align:center;
    cursor:pointer; user-select:none;
  }
  #overlay h1 { font-size:34px; margin:0 0 24px; color:#ffd93d; text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #c0392b; }
  #overlay p { font-family:'VT323', monospace; font-size:26px; line-height:1.5; margin:6px 0; color:#cfe8ff; }
  #overlay .start { margin-top:28px; font-size:18px; color:#7CFC00; animation:blink 1s steps(2) infinite; }
  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity:.25; } }
  .hidden { display:none !important; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap"><canvas id="c"></canvas></div>
<div id="hud">
  <div class="score">SCORE 0</div>
  <div class="lives">HEARTS <span id="hearts">&#9829;&#9829;&#9829;</span></div>
</div>
<div id="overlay">
  <h1>BALLOON POP</h1>
  <p>Click &amp; drag away from the target to draw the bow.<br>
     Release to fire. Pop balloons before they float away!<br>
     Miss 3 and it's game over.</p>
  <div class="start">&gt; CLICK TO START &lt;</div>
</div>

